<Layout title="Terms of use | Baitaan" description="The terms for using Baitaan's free calculators and tools.">
  <article class="space-y-4 leading-relaxed text-ink">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">Terms of use</h1>
    <p>Last updated: November 2026.</p>
    <p>These terms apply to this site. By using it you accept them. If you do not agree, please do not use the site.</p>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">1. Free tools, no account</h2>
    <p>The calculators and tools are free and need no sign-up. You may use them for personal or work purposes.</p>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">2. Results are estimates, not advice</h2>
    <p>Each calculation follows the official rules as we understand them on the date shown on the page. It may not cover your contract, a collective agreement, special regimes or later changes in the law. Results are not legal, tax or financial advice. Check important figures with your employer, the authority concerned or a professional before you rely on them.</p>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">3. No guarantee</h2>
    <p>We work to keep every tool correct and available, but the site is provided as it is, without any guarantee that it is free of errors or always online.</p>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">4. Limits of our responsibility</h2>
    <p>As far as the law allows, we are not responsible for losses that come from using a result or a tool. With the file tools, always keep a copy of your original files.</p>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">5. Your data and files</h2>
    <p>Calculations and files are processed in your browser and are not sent to us. The <a class="text-link underline" href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a> explains the cookies, ads and analytics we use.</p>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">6. Fair use</h2>
    <p>Do not try to break, overload or copy the site in bulk, or present it as your own. You are welcome to link to any page and to share results.</p>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">7. Ads and other sites</h2>
    <p>The site shows ads and links to official sources. We are not responsible for the content of other websites or of the ads.</p>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">8. Our content</h2>
    <p>The text, code and design of Baitaan belong to MAAF Studios. You may quote short passages with a link to the page.</p>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">9. Changes</h2>
    <p>We may update these terms. The date at the top shows the latest version.</p>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">10. Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about these terms: <a class="text-link underline" href="mailto:hello@baitaandessigns.com">hello@baitaandessigns.com</a>.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
